#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:100
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_LearnFromMasterOfPokeblocks"
msgid ""
"Oh, my, my! Are you traveling alone?\n"
"But you're so young! Good for you!\p"
"I'm sure my kids could learn a thing\n"
"or two from you!\p"
"Me? I'm a master of {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"If I get serious just a little, why,\n"
"I can concoct great {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"Would you like to learn from me,\n"
"a master of {POKEBLOCK}S?$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀！你是一个人在旅行吗？\n"
"年纪这么小！真了不起！\p"
"我家的孩子们一定也能\n"
"从你身上学到不少东西！\p"
"我？我是宝可方块的达人。\p"
"只要我稍微认真一点，\n"
"就能调配出很棒的宝可方块。\p"
"要不要跟我这个宝可方块达人\n"
"学一学呀？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:111
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_OhAreYouSure"
msgid ""
"Oh? Are you sure?\p"
"You shouldn't always try to do\n"
"everything by yourself, dear!$"
msgstr ""
"哦？你确定吗？\p"
"不要总想着一个人\n"
"把所有事情都做好哦，孩子！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_ExplainPokeblocks"
msgid ""
"Oh, good! You're a smart soul!\n"
"This is a bit long, so listen up!\p"
"Are you ready?\p"
"If you look at {POKEBLOCK}S, you should see\n"
"that they are rated on how they feel.\p"
"The lower the feel rating,\n"
"the better it is. Don't forget this!\p"
"A good {POKEBLOCK} has a low feel\n"
"rating and a high level.\p"
"A POKéMON can eat more good\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S than ordinary ones, too.\p"
"And this is important.\p"
"If you want to make smooth {POKEBLOCK}S,\n"
"use different kinds of BERRIES.\p"
"Don't be stingy--the kinds of BERRIES\n"
"affect the smoothness of {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"And another thing.\p"
"The more people blending BERRIES,\n"
"the smoother the {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"That's why you should talk to other\n"
"people and make {POKEBLOCK}S together.\p"
"That's about all you need to know to\n"
"make good {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"If everyone had POKéMON they love,\n"
"smooth {POKEBLOCK}S, and a loving family,\l"
"the world would be a happier place.\p"
"Don't give up, dear!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，太好了！你真是个聪明的孩子！\n"
"有点长，要仔细听哦！\p"
"准备好了吗？\p"
"仔细看宝可方块的话，\n"
"会发现它们是按口感来评分的。\p"
"口感的数值越低越好。\n"
"可别忘了这一点哦！\p"
"好的宝可方块口感数值低，\n"
"等级高。\p"
"而且，好的宝可方块比普通的\n"
"能让宝可梦吃更多个。\p"
"接下来这点很重要。\p"
"想做出顺滑的宝可方块，\n"
"就要用不同种类的树果。\p"
"可别小气——树果的种类\n"
"会影响宝可方块的顺滑程度。\p"
"还有一点。\p"
"一起混合树果的人越多，\n"
"宝可方块就越顺滑。\p"
"所以你应该和其他人聊聊，\n"
"大家一起做宝可方块。\p"
"想做出好的宝可方块，\n"
"知道这些就差不多了。\p"
"如果每个人都有心爱的宝可梦、\n"
"顺滑的宝可方块和相亲相爱的家人，\l"
"这个世界会变得更幸福的。\p"
"不要放弃哦，孩子！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:145
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_HappyToHaveQuadruplets"
msgid ""
"When my wife gave birth to quadruplets,\n"
"you bet I was shocked.\p"
"But, now, seeing them play together,\n"
"it makes me happy.$"
msgstr ""
"我老婆生了四胞胎的时候，\n"
"我真的吓了一大跳。\p"
"不过，现在看到他们一起玩耍，\n"
"我就觉得很幸福。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:151
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_GoingToWinMultiBattles"
msgid ""
"We're having MULTI BATTLES, but I know\n"
"I'm going to win.$"
msgstr ""
"我们在进行多人对战，\n"
"不过我知道我一定会赢。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:155
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_LikeMixingAtRecordCorner"
msgid ""
"We like mixing stuff at\n"
"the RECORD CORNER.\p"
"But what gets mixed up?$"
msgstr ""
"我们喜欢在记录角\n"
"混合各种东西。\p"
"可是混合的到底是什么呢？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:160
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_MakePokeblocksWithBerryBlender"
msgid ""
"We're going to make super {POKEBLOCK}S\n"
"with a BERRY BLENDER!$"
msgstr ""
"我们要用树果混合器\n"
"做出超棒的宝可方块！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House3/scripts.inc:164
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House3_Text_GoingToEnterContest"
msgid ""
"I want to brag about how tough my\n"
"POKéMON is, so we're going to enter\l"
"a CONTEST together.$"
msgstr ""
"我想炫耀一下我的宝可梦有多强壮，\n"
"所以我们要一起参加华丽大赛。$"
